      "parameters": {
        "width": 352,
        "height": 576,
        "content": "Workflow Overview\n\nThis workflow provides an earthquake safety check system for employees using P2PQuake, LINE, and Google Sheets.\n\nIt automatically checks for new earthquakes, identifies employees whose home or work prefecture is affected by seismic intensity 4 or higher, and sends a LINE safety check message only to those employees.\n\nEmployees can register their name, home prefecture, and work prefecture through LINE. After receiving a safety check, they reply with 1, 2, or 3 to report their status.\n\nGoogle Sheets stores employee information, safety status, response time, and the last processed earthquake ID to prevent duplicate notifications."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
